# sg13g2_stdcell_hv: no excluded cells.
# The only liberty sequential cells (sg13g2_hv_sdfbbp_1, sg13g2_hv_dlhrq_1)
# are the techmap targets of sdfbbp_map.v / latch_map.v and must stay
# usable. Cells without a liberty view (tri-states, clock gates) can never
# be synthesis targets in the first place.
